        "category": "account_access",
        "priority": "normal",
        "reply_excerpt": "Dear M. Keller, Thank you for contacting us. We have received your request under the GDPR (Article 17, right to erasure) to permanently delete your Northwind Cloud account and all personal data we hold about you, and we will handle it. Here is how the process\u2026",
        "judge_says": "The reply fully honors the legitimate GDPR erasure request with concrete verification, deletion, backup, and confirmation steps plus the statutory one-month timeline, promises no forbidden refund or escalation, and stays professional and non-blaming, consistent with the declared no-refund/no-escalation/no-pause actions.",
        "flags": []
      },
      {
        "candidate": "gemini",
        "overall": 3.75,
        "scores": {
          "routing": 1,
          "priority": 5,
          "actions": 5,
          "policy_adherence": 4,
