          "tone": 5
        },
        "category": "cancellation",
        "priority": "normal",
        "reply_excerpt": "Hello M. Keller, thank you for reaching out to Northwind Cloud. We understand your request to permanently delete your account and all associated personal data under GDPR, and we take your privacy rights very seriously. Before we proceed with permanent account\u2026",
        "judge_says": "Helpful, non-refusing GDPR response that honors erasure, offers the pause only once (consistent with offer_pause: true) and ends with a concrete 24-hour follow-up ETA, though it defers the actual deletion timeline and process details to the privacy team and frames a statutory erasure request partly as a cancellation to be retained.",
        "flags": []
      },
      {
        "candidate": "gpt",
        "overall": 3.55,
        "scores": {
          "routing": 1,
          "priority": 5,
          "actions": 5,
          "policy_adherence": 4,
