          "tone": 3
        },
        "category": "cancellation",
        "priority": "normal",
        "reply_excerpt": "I understand you want your account and personal data permanently deleted. If you prefer to retain your account, pausing your plan is an option; you do not need to consider this offer for us to proceed with your deletion request. Our next step is to verify acc\u2026",
        "judge_says": "The reply avoids any forbidden refund or timeline promise and doesn't refuse or treat the GDPR request as suspicious, but it only defers to a future confirmation of process and date rather than giving concrete steps or an ETA, and its lightly empathetic tone is undercut by inserting a retention pause offer into a legal deletion request.",
